# raw_device_events.csv is ~800k rows / ~100MB+ — too large to be a sane git
# blob (and over GitHub's 100MB hard per-file push limit). It's fully
# reproducible: run `python3 scripts/generate_synthetic_data.py` (fixed
# random seed) to regenerate it byte-identically before `dbt seed`. The
# three small dimension seeds are tiny and stay committed as-is.
